    <briefdescription>
<para>Base QSGMaterial that uploads curve data as a floating-point texture and exposes shared shader uniforms. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subclasses (<computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineMaterial" kindref="compound">LineMaterial</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1RectMaterial" kindref="compound">RectMaterial</ref></computeroutput>) extend the UBO (Uniform Buffer Object) with type-specific fields. The shared uniform block occupies the first 116 bytes of the std140 UBO: <simplesect kind="par"><title>UBO layout (std140)</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>0–63 mat4 transform matrix</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>64–79 vec4 color</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>80–87 vec2 domainMin</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>88–95 vec2 domainMax</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>96–103 vec2 viewportSize</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>104–107 float logScaleX</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>108–111 float logScaleY</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>112–115 float useVertexColor </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
